# Workspace Operating Context

**You must follow all sections below with equal importance.** No section overrides another.

---

## Workspace Organization

This workspace contains a **NopCommerce .NET 4.5.1 → .NET 8.0 migration project** with three key directories:

```
My-Nop-Migration-Workspace/
├── nopCommerce-release-3.90/Nop-Legacy-451/     # SOURCE: .NET Framework 4.5.1 (LEGACY)
│   └── Original NopCommerce 3.90 codebase
├── nopCommerce-release-4.70.0/Nop-Upgraded-80/  # REFERENCE: .NET 8.0 patterns
│   └── NopCommerce 4.70 for .NET 8.0 reference patterns
└── nop-working-code/                            # TARGET: Our working .NET 8.0 migration
    └── Migrated code being upgraded to .NET 8.0
```

**Migration Reference Documentation:**
- Microsoft .NET 8.0 Breaking Changes: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/core/compatibility/8.0
- ASP.NET Core Migration: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/aspnet/core/migration/
- Entity Framework Core: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/ef/core/

**Key Differences (.NET Framework 4.5.1 → .NET 8.0):**
- **Web Framework**: ASP.NET MVC → ASP.NET Core MVC
- **DI**: Autofac only → Autofac + Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection
- **Razor**: `@Html.Action()` → `@await Component.InvokeAsync()` (ViewComponents)
- **Routing**: RouteConfig.cs → Endpoint Routing
- **Configuration**: Web.config → appsettings.json + DI
- **EF**: Entity Framework 6.x → Entity Framework Core
- **Namespace**: `System.Web.*` → `Microsoft.AspNetCore.*`

